        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Pisces &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>Roses go where you point them, and they are hungry.</em></p><p>Each target takes @Damage[1d8[slashing]] damage plus @Damage[1d6[persistent,bleed]] damage, with a basic Reflex save. A successful save negates the persistent damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The slashing damage increases by 1d8. At 9th, 13th, and 17th level, the persistent bleed damage increases by 1d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
